# RAG — 11 Clients, One Doc Each (In‑Memory, No Vector DB)

A minimal setup where you have **11 clients / 1 PDF per client**. Each client is indexed **separately**, and the chatbot answers **only from the selected client’s document**. No external vector DB — just in‑memory embeddings (or optional BM25) and Bedrock Claude 3.5 Sonnet for generation.

